summary: Test that checks if the soundcards detected show all of the expected audio
    jacks (Jack information must be available in the jack_definitions.json file packaged
    with this test in order to run correctly)
description: |
    Maintainer: Erik Hamera <ehamera@redhat.com>
    Test steps:
     * Read in the audio jack definition file
     * Check for any unsupported soundcards present on the work node
     * Check that only expected audio jack names are present
contact: Erik Hamera <ehamera@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
test: ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - python
  - alsa-utils
  - pciutils
  - type: library
    url: https://gitlab.com/redhat/centos-stream/tests/kernel/kernel-tests.git
    name: /audio/functional
duration: 1m
extra-summary: /kernel/audio_tests/functional/audio_jack_sanity_test
extra-task: /kernel/audio_tests/functional/audio_jack_sanity_test
id: 3e8cf23f-5a9d-42c2-b74e-5c88a7c88ec9
